OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with further outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain and hill snow, but turning
OL,9,Fgenerally lighter and more patchy as
OL,10,Fwinds ease overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FIt will stay cloudy with
OL,13,Ffurther outbreaks of mostly light
OL,14,Fpatchy rain. Turning drier across
OL,15,FAngus through the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
